category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libboost-devel
sdesc: "URI C++ library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "C++ library for parsing and generating RFC-compliant Uniform Resource
Identifiers (URI). Contains classes for URI scheme, authority, path, query,
fragment, and the combined URI."
